    "title": "ODA Annual Session",
    "description": "This app will make your experience at the 2024 Ohio Dental Association Annual Session much more complete!  Contact other attendees. Get information about the Exhibit Hall. See maps of local hotels and the Convention Center.  Plus, you can redeem your Continuing Education Credits right in the app!\r\n\r\nPlease let us know how we did -- we're always looking for feedback to improve.  Enjoy!",
